    These are planning judgments built from official recruitment notices, AICTE-linked reporting and
    published salary sources, not fixed rules. Pay, hiring and exam cycles change; check the source
    linked in each section before acting.
  </p>

  <h2 id="your-situation">Start from your situation, not your branch</h2>

  <p>
    The same lane looks different depending on where you stand today. A pre-final-year student can
    test cheaply. A graduate with a gap year needs a fixed checkpoint. Find your row first.
  </p>

  <div class="employer-grid">
    {situations.map((item) => (
